@host = http://localhost:5180

### Minimal API - valid order (200)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Quarterly stationery order",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "PEN001" },
    { "sku": "PAD014" }
  ]
}

### Minimal API - invalid order (400): empty description, two empty SKUs
POST {{host}}/api/orders/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "" },
    { "sku": "" }
  ]
}

### MVC controller - valid order (200)
POST {{host}}/api/controller/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Quarterly stationery order",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "PEN001" },
    { "sku": "PAD014" }
  ]
}

### MVC controller - invalid order (400): empty description, two empty SKUs
POST {{host}}/api/controller/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "" },
    { "sku": "" }
  ]
}

### Registrations - valid coupon (200)
POST {{host}}/api/registrations/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactEmail": "attendee@example.com",
  "eventName": "Formidable Conf",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-01",
  "ticketTier": "General admission",
  "venueRegion": "Southern",
  "dietaryNotes": "None",
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10"
}

### Registrations - unrecognised coupon (400): server-only rejection
POST {{host}}/api/registrations/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactEmail": "attendee@example.com",
  "eventName": "Formidable Conf",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-01",
  "ticketTier": "General admission",
  "venueRegion": "Southern",
  "dietaryNotes": "None",
  "couponCode": "BOGUS"
}

### Registrations - model-invalid (400): empty ContactEmail/EventName, from the filter
POST {{host}}/api/registrations/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactEmail": "",
  "eventName": "",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-01",
  "ticketTier": "General admission",
  "venueRegion": "Southern",
  "dietaryNotes": "None",
  "couponCode": ""
}
